      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p53_b2",
      "text": "agreement improves to 85.7%; the proxy is useful but still imperfect, and DRRO achieves\nits clearest frontier improvement.\nWith the larger proxy, agreement reaches 95.2%;\nproxy and gold are nearly rank-aligned, so the methods naturally cluster together. The\ncomparison indicates that DRRO is most valuable when the proxy is informative but\nnot fully aligned with the held-out evaluator. If the proxy is very weak, all methods are\n",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        146.39,
        524.97,
        229.97
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
